    ns1:description "Disassemble the crib into main material streams for proper recycling. - Solid wood components: send to wood recycling or energy recovery. - Melamine board parts: dispose via controlled waste facilities. - Metal fittings: recycle as scrap metal. - Plastic wheels: recycle if local facilities allow, otherwise landfill. Ensure separation of materials before disposal to maximize recycling efficiency."^^xsd:string ;
    ns1:name "End-of-Life Disposal"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Disposal instruction of End-of-Life Disposal with ID YxYvMv" .

